  "合作面包房停业十七年，街边保温柜却每天在黎明前多出一只温热面包。柜边只有十二枚黄铜持份环的磨痕，没有第十三枚；来取面包的人也不是固定的一位。城市把它归为无主货物，柜门却显然一直被许多人共同维护。": "The cooperative bakery closed seventeen years ago, yet each day before dawn the roadside warming cabinet holds one more warm loaf. Around the cabinet there are only the wear-marks of twelve brass tally rings — never a thirteenth — and the one who collects the loaf is never the same person. The city files it as ownerless goods, though the cabinet door has plainly been kept up by many hands together.",
  "如果合作社只有十二名持份人，为什么每天稳定烤出第十三只面包？": "If the cooperative has only twelve shareholders, why is a thirteenth loaf baked, reliably, every day?",
