  "00:42 — 十二件围裙在空工作台前同时摆动。": "00:42 — Twelve aprons sway together before the empty workbench.",
  "01:25 — 工资簿最后一行停在第十二个签名。": "01:25 — The wage ledger's last line stops at the twelfth signature.",
  "02:31 — 空白访客牌从账页夹层滑落。": "02:31 — The blank guest token slips from between the ledger pages.",
  "03:56 — 送货车在免费诊所门口停下。": "03:56 — The delivery cart halts at the door of the free clinic.",
  "05:02 — 第十三只面包被一双陌生手取走。": "05:02 — The thirteenth loaf is taken away by a pair of unfamiliar hands.",
  "工资簿、围裙、工作台和黄铜持份环都只属于十二个人。夹在章程里的空白访客牌没有姓名、工时或投票权，却写在每日烘焙量的算法里。第十三只面包不是被删掉成员的工资，而是合作社主动留下的一份不问身份的早餐。": "The wage ledger, the aprons, the workbench and the brass tally rings all belong to just twelve people. The blank guest token tucked into the charter carries no name, no hours and no vote, yet it is written into the arithmetic of each day's baking. The thirteenth loaf is not the wage of a deleted member; it is a breakfast the cooperative deliberately leaves behind, asking no one who they are.",
  "空白访客牌没有姓名和投票权，为什么仍被写进每日必须完成的烘焙量？": "Why, having neither name nor vote, is the blank guest token still written into the baking quota that must be met each day?",
  "火从炉外开始": "The Fire Began Outside the Oven",
  "市政报告指控煤炉，焦痕与熔断器却把方向指向炉桥下的热力主管。": "The municipal report blames the coal oven, yet the scorch and the fuse point the bearing toward the heat main beneath the furnace bridge.",
  "一场火若来自公共管道，就很难只由一家小店负责。": "If a fire comes from a public conduit, it is hard to hold a single small shop responsible for it.",
  "十七年前关闭合作社的火灾，究竟从哪里烧进来？": "Where did the fire that closed the cooperative seventeen years ago actually burn in from?",
