  "03:32 — 费澄取出未提交的修正页。": "03:32 — Fei Cheng takes out the unsubmitted correction page.",
  "05:11 — 阀门房终于承认当年超压。": "05:11 — The valve house at last admits the over-pressure of that year.",
  "面包炉内壁没有起火裂纹，热力主管的熔断器却从市政侧向店内熔化。退役检察员费澄当年写过修正页，认定炉桥阀门超压；上级要求他把原因改成合作社违规用煤。火灾报告不仅夺走房契，也把公共设施的责任转嫁给了十二名烘焙师。": "The inner walls of the bread oven bear no ignition cracks, yet the fuse on the heat main melted from the municipal side inward toward the shop. Fei Cheng, the retired inspector, once wrote a correction page finding that the furnace-bridge valve had been over-pressured; his superiors ordered him to change the cause to the cooperative's improper use of coal. The fire report not only took away the deed, it shifted the responsibility of a public utility onto twelve bakers.",
  "若火灾始于面包炉，为什么熔断器和焦痕都从市政热力管一侧先受损？": "If the fire began in the bread oven, why did both the fuse and the scorch take damage first from the side of the municipal heat main?",
  "整座街区保管一块酵母": "A Whole Quarter Keeps One Starter",
  "合作社没有消失，它把一团活酵母拆成许多窗台上的微小证词。": "The cooperative has not vanished; it has broken one living starter into many tiny testimonies on windowsills.",
  "一件财产分给足够多人保管以后，没收处会称它为无法定位的潮气。": "Once a piece of property is shared out among enough people to keep, the confiscation office calls it damp air that cannot be located.",
  "停业以后，第十三只面包为什么从未中断？": "After the closure, why has the thirteenth loaf never once been interrupted?",
  "清点窗台酵母罐": "Take stock of the windowsill starter jars",
  "每户只保管一小勺活着的历史。": "Each household keeps only a small spoonful of living history.",
