  "账簿会记录劳动，不记录领袖。": "The ledger records labour, not leaders.",
  "和柯遥走完送货线": "Walk Ke Yao's delivery line to its end",
  "面包抵达之处比店址更接近合作社。": "Where the bread arrives is closer to the cooperative than the shop's address.",
