  "00:40 — 第一户窗台送下一勺活酵母。": "00:40 — The first windowsill sends down a spoonful of living starter.",
  "01:23 — 十二条细路在地下炉前汇合。": "01:23 — Twelve slender paths converge before the underground oven.",
  "02:52 — 夜账只记录劳动时长，不写负责人。": "02:52 — The night ledger records only hours of labour, naming no one in charge.",
  "03:43 — 柯遥装好诊所与候车室的面包。": "03:43 — Ke Yao loads the bread for the clinic and the waiting room.",
  "05:07 — 所有酵母罐各自带回一小份。": "05:07 — Every starter jar carries back its own small portion.",
  "十二名成员把母酵分给煤钟街和黎明粮仓的住户，每户保管一小勺，夜里再轮流送到地下公共炉。夜账没有领袖签名，只有谁揉面、谁看火、谁骑车；柯遥把第十三只面包送往诊所、候车室和街边柜。合作社从一栋房子变成了许多人重复的一套动作。": "The twelve members shared the mother starter among the households of Coalbell Street and the Dawn Granary, each keeping a small spoonful, then carried it in turn to the underground communal oven at night. The night ledger holds no leader's signature — only who kneaded, who watched the fire, who cycled; Ke Yao took the thirteenth loaf to the clinic, the waiting room and the roadside cabinet. The cooperative changed from a single building into one set of actions repeated by many people.",
  "如果合作社已被没收，为什么没有任何单一负责人仍能让它每夜完整运转？": "If the cooperative has already been confiscated, why can no single person in charge still keep it running whole, night after night?",
  "把一份归还给无人": "Returning One Share to No One",
  "房契可以还给十二名持份人，第十三份却必须继续不属于任何人。": "The deed can be returned to the twelve shareholders, but the thirteenth share must go on belonging to no one.",
  "城市终于同意归还财产，只是不理解为何有人拒绝把最后一份写进姓名栏。": "The city has finally agreed to return the property; it simply cannot understand why anyone would refuse to write the last share into the name column.",
  "怎样归还合作社，才不会把公共早餐变成第十三份私人财产？": "How can the cooperative be returned without turning a public breakfast into a thirteenth piece of private property?",
