  "何砾修复了原房契，费澄愿意公开修正报告，十二名成员也都还活着。真正困难的是第十三份：它从来没有所有者，不能在补偿时被某个人领取。宋岑提出把房契还给十二人，把街边柜和每日一只面包写成不可出售、不可取消、由社区轮值维护的公共使用权。": "He Li has restored the original deed, Fei Cheng is willing to make the correction report public, and all twelve members are still alive. The truly difficult part is the thirteenth share: it never had an owner, and cannot be claimed by any one person during compensation. Song Cen proposes returning the deed to the twelve, and writing the roadside cabinet and the daily loaf as a public right of use — not for sale, not to be cancelled, maintained by the quarter in rotation.",
  "财产归还通常要求写明所有者，为什么真相反而要求第十三栏永远空白？": "Returning property usually requires an owner to be named; why does the truth instead require the thirteenth column to stay forever blank?",
