  "柜中多出的一只之间的一次炉火回声": "An Oven-Fire Echo Within 'The Extra One in the Cabinet'",
  "你短暂醒来时，窗外传来柜门轻响，一小段揉面声从“柜中多出的一只”里漏进房间。": "When you wake briefly, the cabinet door clicks softly outside the window, and a short passage of kneading slips into the room from 'The Extra One in the Cabinet'.",
  "林渡在蒸汽雾里回头，看见第 1 夜的路线绕开一张要求写明所有者的表格。": "Lin Du turns in the steam-mist and sees Night 1's route skirt a form demanding that an owner be named.",
  "这次醒转没有结束夜班。城市只趁你翻身时，把一小段尚有余温的公共劳动夹进报告。": "This waking does not end the night shift. The city merely tucks a short, still-warm passage of communal labour into the report while you turn over.",
  "没有第十三名烘焙师之间的一次炉火回声": "An Oven-Fire Echo Within 'There Is No Thirteenth Baker'",
  "你短暂醒来时，窗外传来柜门轻响，一小段揉面声从“没有第十三名烘焙师”里漏进房间。": "When you wake briefly, the cabinet door clicks softly outside the window, and a short passage of kneading slips into the room from 'There Is No Thirteenth Baker'.",
  "林渡在蒸汽雾里回头，看见第 2 夜的路线绕开一张要求写明所有者的表格。": "Lin Du turns in the steam-mist and sees Night 2's route skirt a form demanding that an owner be named.",
